With these three small edits:

- `<Tabs>` computes `totalTabs = this.getTabs().length` and passes it into each `<Tab>` via `totalCount`.
- `<Tab>` picks up `totalCount` from `props` and adds `aria-posinset` (its 1-based index in the set) and `aria-setsize` (the overall number of tabs) to the link. 

VoiceOver will now properly announce “Tab Label, selected, tab, X of N.”
